    "body": "<h2>Meet our team</h2>\n<p>The Brilliant Minds Behind IT Charging. At IT Charging, we pride ourselves on the expertise and dedication of our team members. Each individual brings a unique set of skills and experiences to the table, contributing to the vibrant tapestry that is our collective knowledge. Get to know the faces behind the screens:</p>\n<div style=\"height: min(2.5rem, 3vw); width: 0px;\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<div style=\"padding-right: 0; padding-left: 0;\">\n<div><img class=\"wp-image-107\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 1; object-fit: cover;\" src=\"https://www.itcharging.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/Alora.jpg\" alt=\"\">\n<p><strong>Alora</strong> <strong>Daunt</strong></p>\n<p>Founder &amp; Chief Editor</p>\n<div><img class=\"wp-image-108\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 1; object-fit: cover;\" src=\"https://www.itcharging.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/Luka.jpg\" alt=\"\">\n<p><strong>Luka</strong> <a><strong>Dončić</strong></a></p>\n<p>Lead Writer</p>\n<div><img class=\"wp-image-109\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 1; object-fit: cover;\" src=\"https://www.itcharging.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/Vivian-Balakar.jpg\" alt=\"\">\n<p><strong>Vivian</strong> <strong>Balakrishnan</strong></p>\n<p>Tech Guru</p>\n<div><img class=\"wp-image-115\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 1; object-fit: cover;\" src=\"https://www.itcharging.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/Gangesh.jpg\" alt=\"\">\n<p><strong>Gangesh</strong></p>\n<p><em>Senior Technology Analyst</em></p>\n<div style=\"padding-right: 0; padding-left: 0;\">\n<div><img class=\"wp-image-111\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 1; object-fit: cover;\" src=\"https://www.itcharging.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/Isabella-Gomaz.jpg\" alt=\"\">\n<p><strong>Isabella Gomaz</strong></p>\n<p>Social Media Maven</p>\n<div><img class=\"wp-image-110\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 1; object-fit: cover;\" src=\"https://www.itcharging.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/Colter.jpg\" alt=\"\">\n<p><strong>Colter</strong> <strong>Wall</strong></p>\n<p>Guest Writers</p>\n<div><img class=\"wp-image-113\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 1; object-fit: cover;\" src=\"https://www.itcharging.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/Fang-Shui.jpg\" alt=\"\">\n<p><strong>Feng</strong></p>\n<p>Subject Matter Expert</p>\n<div><img class=\"wp-image-114\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 1; object-fit: cover;\" src=\"https://www.itcharging.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/Roger.jpg\" alt=\"\">\n<p><strong>Roger</strong></p>\n<p>Graphic Designer</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
